			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Normalize Vine imports in GenericRequest handlers\n\nRefactor 24 CocoonService generic request handlers across Commands, Secrets, and WindowDialogs services to separate local `crate::` bindings from absolute `::Vine::Generated` path imports. Apply consistent two-line import pattern to InitialHandshake and MountainVinegRPCService.\n\nThis continues the absolute-path migration that eliminates local re-export indirection for the gRPC protocol layer, ensuring all Vine type references delegate exclusively to the canonical Vine library crate.",
