			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Complete absolute-path migration for IPC boundaries\n\nAdvance the Element submodule pointer to 67b9d58e, removing the final Vine re-export modules and completing the absolute-path delegation pattern across all IPC boundaries.\n\nMountain eliminates the deprecated `Generated` and `Client` module re-exports from `Source/Vine/mod.rs`. Refactor 90+ RPC handler files across Auth, Command, FileSystem, Provider, Window, Workspace, and Terminal services to use `::Vine::Generated` instead of `crate::Vine::Generated`. Delete the remaining wrapper modules in `Source/Air/mod.rs`, `Source/Cache/mod.rs`, and `Source/Vine/Server/Notification/Support/mod.rs`, updating imports to reference `::AirLibrary::Client::AirClient` directly.\n\nImpact: Mountain's IPC and service layers now delegate exclusively to canonical Vine/Cache/Air library crates with zero local re-export indirection. The absolute-path migration is complete across all three dependency boundaries.",
